{
  "name": "Delivery Reviews",
  "description": "The Monday delivery review an agent writes from the records above: contract value at risk, unbilled work, which projects slipped and why, which clients have gone quiet.",
  "position": 3,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "write-review",
      "label": {
        "en": "Write this Monday’s delivery review",
        "zh-CN": "写本周一的交付周报"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-client-delivery` skill in this folder and follow it. Write the delivery review for last Monday to Sunday from the projects, signals and actions: a one-line headline, contract value at risk, unbilled work, how many projects are on track, every at-risk project with what is wrong and the action, every client we have not checked in with for 14 days, and what changed since last week. Save it as a draft.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-client-delivery` Skill，按它的规则做。根据项目、信号和跟进措施，写上周一到周日的交付周报：一句话结论、有风险的合同额、未开票金额、正常项目数、每个有风险项目的问题和对应措施、14 天没沟通的客户、与上周相比的变化。保存为草稿。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "compare-weeks",
      "label": {
        "en": "What got better or worse since last week?",
        "zh-CN": "和上周比哪些变好了、哪些变差了"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-client-delivery` skill in this folder and follow it. Compare the two latest reviews and the signals between them: contract value at risk, unbilled work, which projects changed status, and which actions closed. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-client-delivery` Skill，按它的规则做。对比最近两份周报和期间的信号：有风险的合同额、未开票金额、哪些项目换了状态、哪些跟进措施完成了。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
